File 3: anu/voice_controller.cc (Complete Drop-In)
Implements 3-slot EEPROM storage at 256, 417, and 578 via avr/eeprom.h, strips all drum_synth and wav_res_drum_map_node_* references, and applies slide_latched_ inside RecordStep().

cpp
// Copyright 2012 Emilie Gillet.
//
// Author: Emilie Gillet (emilie.o.gillet@gmail.com)
